## Setup

```powershell
cd path\to\ledger
py -3 -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

### Private companion (live holdings)

Live positions live in a **private** GitHub repo, not in this public tree:

```powershell
cd ..
git clone https://github.com/AlexTouvras/ledger-private.git
```

Place the checkout beside this repo as `../ledger-private` (or set `LEDGER_PRIVATE_ROOT`, or copy `configs/companion.local.yaml.example` → `companion.local.yaml`).

```powershell
invest status          # shows companion path
invest holdings ingest # writes holdings_nordnet.yaml into the companion
invest research --publish-orbit
# then in the Orbit checkout: git add public/ledger-research && commit && push main
```

Do not commit holdings into the public ledger repo.

## Public vs private

| Path | Audience |
|------|----------|
| `dashboard/research/` | Portfolio-safe HTML + JSON history |
| `reports/` | Local only (gitignored) — full private review detail |
| [ledger-private](https://github.com/AlexTouvras/ledger-private) | Private — live holdings + capital map |

Deploy the static dashboard folder (or sync `dashboard/research` into Orbit `public/ledger-research` as this site does).

